
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`JSON_APPEND: number = -1`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer JSON_APPEND = -1;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  Use 'lljson.decode' and 'table.insert' instead.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>The integer constant JSON_APPEND has the value -1</p>
  <p>A special specifier for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlJsonSetValue" target="_blank">llJsonSetValue</a> which indicates the given value should be appended to the array at the specified level.</p>
  <p>Care should be taken, as if the value at that level is not an array, the existing data will be overwritten and replaced with the array meant for appending.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Related Articles</h2>
  <h3>Functions</h3>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>•</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlJsonSetValue" target="_blank">llJsonSetValue</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p><a href="https://secondlife.canny.io/?search=JSON_APPEND" target="_blank">Search Canny for related Issues</a></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`
JSON_APPEND = -1
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
integer JSON_APPEND = -1;
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      